# Dashboard header vs ribbon

On Staff Overview (`employee-overview-page`) and similar dashboards:

- **Ribbon** = top app chrome (`useSetRibbon` / `RibbonTitle` + Close). Page title only; do not put dashboard actions there unless the user explicitly says ribbon.
- **Dashboard header** = the in-page bar that holds the township / position (and similar) filter selects.

When the user says **header**, **dashboard header**, or **menu on the header**, put controls on that filter bar (right end), **not** in the ribbon.
